msgid "All temperatures is in"
msgstr "Alle Temperaturen sind drin"

#: plugins/photovoltaic_boiler/templates/photovoltaic_boiler_help.html:12 plugins/pool_heating/templates/pool_heating_help.html:13
msgid "Or in OSPy sensors as well also in"
msgstr "Oder auch in OSPy-Sensoren"

