msgstr "Astro-Sonnenaufgang und -Sonnenuntergang – Einstellungen"

#: plugins/sunrise_and_sunset/templates/sunrise_and_sunset_setup.html:78
msgid "The selected program that we want to run with this extension does not have to be enabled in the programs, but it must have set days when we want the program to run."
